{"availability":"available","full":"Nonarkara/airdash","name":"airdash","description":"AirDash — 24/7 PM2.5 and air-quality watch for Thailand (TH/EN).","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-16T16:57:05Z","updated":"2026-10-15T18:21:49Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://air.nonarkara.org","topics":["air-quality","civic-tech","dashboard","pm25","thailand"],"demo":"https://air.nonarkara.org/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T17:58:53.433Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T17:58:53.433Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T17:58:53.433Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T18:43:06.674Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-09T19:33:48.310Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T19:04:05.373Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T17:58:53.433Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A one-Mac civic system: bilingual Thai/English, honest about where every number comes from, useful in five seconds on a phone. The manga banner above is illustration, not a claim that software defeats haze.","An operating system for air-quality decision making — with two front doors. Air Story (/) is a scroll-based bilingual narrative for smart kids and curious adults: a breathing hero tinted by the live Thai AQI band, your day in cigarette-equivalents, the national haze bill, and every formula with its receipt. Mission Control (/ops.html) is the preserved operator dashboard for mayors, district officials, researchers, journalists, and air detectives. Figures follow each upstream publication cadence from Thai government and open scientific sources, with provenance and explicit model limitations,…","🇹🇭 Live: air.nonarkara.org · 🔀 Fork it: github.com/Nonarkara/airdash · 📐 System architecture: ARCHITECTURE.md · 🇹🇭 ฉบับภาษาไทย: README.th.md"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Nonarkara/airdash/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ba89ad858e627fcb68f4be26